{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:0.1", "PA_ja_179:0.2", "PA_ja_179:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), The Chapter on the Virtuous (Kalyāṇavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:0.4"], "en": "9. The Story of the Hundredfold Dharma:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:1.1", "PA_ja_179:1.2"], "en": "“That gift was small and leftover, and it was given by him with difficulty.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:1.3"], "en": "“I am of brahmin birth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:1.4"], "en": "yet even what I have eaten has risen up [as bile].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:2.1"], "en": "Having thus disregarded the Dhamma,”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:2.2", "PA_ja_179:2.3"], "en": "He who lives by what is contrary to the Dhamma does not rejoice even in gains obtained,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:2.4"], "en": "just as one who possesses the hundredfold Dhamma does not rejoice in a mere acquisition.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_179:3.1"], "en": "The Satadhamma Jātaka, the ninth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
